<title>MEXICO: BIPER STARTS SERVICE IN SAN SALVADOR.</title>
<headline>BIPER STARTS SERVICE IN SAN SALVADOR.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican paging company Biper said on Thursday it had begun operations in San Salvador through its Contactel service.</p>
<p>&quot;The service will have local coverage in the city of San Salvador and then additionally cover the main cities in the country (El Salvador),&quot; a statement by Biper said.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9549))</p>
